# Experiment outputs / generated data.
# Small, human-readable result files (the ones cited by report numbers -- summaries, per-seed
# raw episode data, small activity arrays) are tracked for reproducibility, per file size, not
# by name pattern: everything under experiments/**/results/ is tracked EXCEPT the specific large
# bulk per-decision dumps listed below (each 2.7-3.0 MB, regenerable from
# run_oracle_comparison*.py). See docs/RESEARCH_LOG.md / docs/PHASE_INDEX.md and each phase's
# *_REPORT.md for which files back which reported number.
experiments/**/outputs/
experiments/phase_b/results/large_sparse_counterfactual_raw.json
experiments/phase_b/results/revised_large_sparse_counterfactual_raw.json
experiments/phase_b/results/revised_small_dense_counterfactual_raw.json
experiments/phase_b/results/small_dense_counterfactual_raw.json
